{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把“先别被悲伤带走”偏成了“压住对过去的眷恋”。原文重点是不让悲伤吞没自己，并非压抑对过去的想念。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把“越想控制局面，越感到刺痛和疲惫”改写成了“越无法摆脱反复出现的思绪”，因果重点有所偏移；另外漏掉了身体一直被催促、无法停下来的状态。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。释然略带概括性，但没有实质改变原文安静接纳、珍惜余温的意思。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"没有明确拼出“困扰并未消失”这一重要限定，只说心里稍稍松弛、仍有余悸。短暂喘息不等于问题解决，这层意思没有充分表达。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"漏掉了关键意思：零碎的想念虽然让他暂时说不清未来怎么过，却没有让他撤回先前的选择。其余对回忆零碎、疲惫和迷惘的理解基本准确。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲故事与完整稿是同一件事：一个人在失落与对旧日生活的眷恋中选择维护尊严，经历焦虑、反复动摇和短暂平静，逐渐学会不必消除想念或等待内心完全安定，也能继续生活，最终让怀念与坚持同时存在。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c3b711f2-73ec-4369-aae6-6c6688a4c16f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T125228085164Z", "elapsed_seconds": 180.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T12:55:28.517866+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f43f523846f22f496959a622afc8930e3b2b4a5ab42a7a13115a63be3fc08c1c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T125228085164Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "29baf1d1b79bc8a92b5f16a26aa69d9fa4b56e3629c96c640e034a08cc659ba0"}}}
